 # fc_nnue_h256_e12_ep12_ep10base — H256 net (run e, epoch 12) on the locked ep10 source base
+
+## S10 ImprovingRazorGuard experiment — 2026-10-26
+
+UNPROVEN. Do not razor a non-PV node whose static evaluation is improving. Preserve the existing razor margin and qsearch fallback for other nodes.
+Build FORGE_S10_IMPROVING_RAZOR=ON, then set UCI ImprovingRazorGuard=true before search. Both defaults are OFF. The option is advertised only in an enabled build. One atomic request is snapshotted before worker launch; hot search reads a worker-local copy. The first active search of a searcher reports `info string ImprovingRazorGuard active`; the bench searcher explicitly inherits the option. No strength or speed conclusion is made. Qualification requires the full fixed OFF references, full correctness suite, all five ON depths, ON d11 differing from308972, and the specified WAC screen.
